    "segments": [
      {
        "role": "m",
        "speaker": "M",
        "sourceStart": 3,
        "sourceEnd": 234,
        "text": "Good evening, everyone. Thanks for coming to the allotment society meeting. I'm David, the treasurer. Tonight we need to look at how we share out our money for next season, and then do a stage check on the jobs we agreed to finish.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-GB-RyanNeural",
        "textHash": "28cf68d890aaf8ede618cb459616d0cbcec68f7b5c953ab99e0751e845f00b9a",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0
      },
      {
        "role": "w",
        "speaker": "W",
        "sourceStart": 238,
        "sourceEnd": 429,
        "text": "Hi, I'm Sarah. I look after the tool shed. Before we start, I should say we still have plenty of seeds for the spring, but we are short of fertilizer. Last month we used more than we planned.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-GB-SoniaNeural",
        "textHash": "a46abb5907b04f744ff499ec09f95b33cbf6c26c2bebaac3b1dad716109062f4",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "m",
        "speaker": "M",
        "sourceStart": 433,
        "sourceEnd": 579,
        "text": "Right. So if we buy more fertilizer now, we will have enough for the whole season. But it costs about two hundred dollars. Does anyone have ideas?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-GB-RyanNeural",
        "textHash": "453fb20567135870315c65e6987c236647a279552653837df3bad52b097effc2",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "w",
        "speaker": "W",
        "sourceStart": 583,
        "sourceEnd": 686,
        "text": "Well, we could ask local shops for donations. If each shop gives a small amount, we can cover the cost.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-GB-SoniaNeural",
        "textHash": "ed74c8cf1c769f255dce355c13d630397ab8531e100c5ae7cd9c7971d004385d",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "m",
        "speaker": "M",
        "sourceStart": 690,
        "sourceEnd": 833,
        "text": "That's a good idea. Let's move on to the stage check. We planned to build three new raised beds by the end of April. How many have we finished?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-GB-RyanNeural",
        "textHash": "79723434f341deccde8bf901c5da8c85d0014b99dbec0724321474b2d8cb175b",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "w",
        "speaker": "W",
        "sourceStart": 837,
        "sourceEnd": 950,
        "text": "We've completed two beds. The third one is half done. We need more wood. Actually, we need about ten more planks.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-GB-SoniaNeural",
        "textHash": "cf12a36696dddffac4176a8edbe5ffd42b0a408183260622d5174ff82ff1b96b",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "m",
        "speaker": "M",
        "sourceStart": 954,
        "sourceEnd": 1117,
        "text": "OK. So if we get the wood this week, we can finish the third bed by next weekend. Now, about the watering system. We agreed to install a drip system. Is that done?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-GB-RyanNeural",
        "textHash": "ca4a26b25bbfaea1bd9e5808ba25f2d67b03fb65b60e7b7fbf9bcb29ef3f6034",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "w",
        "speaker": "W",
        "sourceStart": 1121,
        "sourceEnd": 1238,
        "text": "Not yet. We have the pipes, but we haven't connected them. We need a plumber. I asked one, but he is busy until June.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-GB-SoniaNeural",
        "textHash": "570e1b2302c8d0382005fb6d06690142b3211cf85d3c4b6e90349c98c4471a87",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "m",
        "speaker": "M",
        "sourceStart": 1242,
        "sourceEnd": 1365,
        "text": "Hmm. That's a delay. Maybe we can ask a volunteer who knows about plumbing. If we find someone, we can save money and time.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-GB-RyanNeural",
        "textHash": "279e56f0e94b6802ff8c418b2dd799ee362bde93537a94f72d50744b7bb34ff4",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "w",
        "speaker": "W",
        "sourceStart": 1369,
        "sourceEnd": 1541,
        "text": "Yes, I'll ask around. Also, we need to think about the compost. We have two compost bins. One is full, and the other is almost empty. We should turn the full one this week.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-GB-SoniaNeural",
        "textHash": "159af5b631ab7f345428a41dbe71164654855409d8281209a68ad58723c2811b",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "m",
        "speaker": "M",
        "sourceStart": 1545,
        "sourceEnd": 1745,
        "text": "Good point. Let's also check the budget. We have five hundred dollars left. We need to spend some on fertilizer and wood. If we spend three hundred on those, we will have two hundred for other things.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-GB-RyanNeural",
        "textHash": "83f0360c608ae116ba30c6f3c5d2ecdbeaa33593e9655f0e2e791ed16c1bde4e",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "w",
        "speaker": "W",
        "sourceStart": 1749,
        "sourceEnd": 1873,
        "text": "That sounds reasonable. But remember, we also need to buy new gloves. Some volunteers complained that the old ones are torn.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-GB-SoniaNeural",
        "textHash": "eb0217f1fcb8fa1f723915b881e3388ff745d8a84975f4c998654616de1ed3ad",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "m",
        "speaker": "M",
        "sourceStart": 1877,
        "sourceEnd": 1987,
        "text": "OK, we'll add gloves to the list. Now, let's decide who does what. Sarah, can you contact shops for donations?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-GB-RyanNeural",
        "textHash": "ecc5ff8851a10aa4079b07ad0baabaa7e31b7bd67ed54d189dc546f91354af4d",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "w",
        "speaker": "W",
        "sourceStart": 1991,
        "sourceEnd": 2042,
        "text": "Sure. And I can also ask about a volunteer plumber.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-GB-SoniaNeural",
        "textHash": "4d65466983e8592becba3d6ad2131ce44cef28cf01f8b7d1ee57345812a15b00",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "m",
        "speaker": "M",
        "sourceStart": 2046,
        "sourceEnd": 2154,
        "text": "Great. I'll order the wood and fertilizer. We'll meet again next Friday to check progress. Thanks, everyone.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-GB-RyanNeural",
        "textHash": "f0e7e9b00b446d367980b42ca5f7cbc6917115a6320d8c4cb28c308723e7f942",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      }
    ]
  },
